1f:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[["$","section","0-What the calculator includes",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What the calculator includes"}],[["$","p","ECTS describes learning outcomes and their associated workload. For planning, include classes, reading, assignments, projects, preparation and assessment time when those activities belong to the course. Contact hours alone usually describe only part of the work.",{"children":"ECTS describes learning outcomes and their associated workload. For planning, include classes, reading, assignments, projects, preparation and assessment time when those activities belong to the course. Contact hours alone usually describe only part of the work."}],["$","p","The calculator lets you enter a workload factor rather than hiding a universal conversion. Its example factor is editable. Use the value published by the institution for your programme and check the academic period to which the workload belongs.",{"children":"The calculator lets you enter a workload factor rather than hiding a universal conversion. Its example factor is editable. Use the value published by the institution for your programme and check the academic period to which the workload belongs."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","1-Two directions, one transparent formula",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Two directions, one transparent formula"}],[["$","p","Use hours-to-credits when you have a total workload estimate. Use credits-to-hours when the course catalogue already gives ECTS and you want to plan study time. Keep the total for one period consistent: do not combine one semester’s classes with a whole year’s credit target.",{"children":"Use hours-to-credits when you have a total workload estimate. Use credits-to-hours when the course catalogue already gives ECTS and you want to plan study time. Keep the total for one period consistent: do not combine one semester’s classes with a whole year’s credit target."}],["$","p","These examples use different explicit factors to show why the institution’s rule matters. Neither factor establishes recognition of a course at another university.",{"children":"These examples use different explicit factors to show why the institution’s rule matters. Neither factor establishes recognition of a course at another university."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Worked arithmetic examples","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Worked arithmetic examples"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Task",{"scope":"col","children":"Task"}],["$","th","Inputs",{"scope":"col","children":"Inputs"}],["$","th","Result",{"scope":"col","children":"Result"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Hours to workload credits"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"150 total hours ÷ 25 hours per credit"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"6 ECTS workload equivalent"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Credits to hours"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"6 ECTS × 30 hours per credit"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"180 total hours"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Weekly planning"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"180 hours ÷ 12 study weeks"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"15 hours per week"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Why it is not a US-credit or recognition converter",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":["$L22",["$L23","$L24"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L25","$L26","$L27"]}]
