23:["$","p","A numerical workload estimate cannot determine whether another university accepts the learning outcomes, assessment level or course content. Official transfer and recognition depend on institutional decisions and agreements, not only a ratio.",{"children":"A numerical workload estimate cannot determine whether another university accepts the learning outcomes, assessment level or course content. Official transfer and recognition depend on institutional decisions and agreements, not only a ratio."}]
24:["$","p","If your transcript uses a different credit system, collect the official credit definition and course information. Ask the receiving institution how to present it. Do not relabel your transcript using the calculator output or claim an officially converted qualification.",{"children":"If your transcript uses a different credit system, collect the official credit definition and course information. Ask the receiving institution how to present it. Do not relabel your transcript using the calculator output or claim an officially converted qualification."}]
25:["$","section","3-Check the input before trusting the result",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the input before trusting the result"}],[["$","p","Enter non-negative hours or credits and a positive workload factor. Zero workload gives zero estimated credits; a zero hours-per-credit factor is invalid. Blank fields must be completed rather than silently treated as zero.",{"children":"Enter non-negative hours or credits and a positive workload factor. Zero workload gives zero estimated credits; a zero hours-per-credit factor is invalid. Blank fields must be completed rather than silently treated as zero."}],["$","p","If the workload estimate includes the same activity twice, the output will overstate credits. Review course totals and assessment weeks. Keep intermediate values unrounded where possible and round only the displayed planning result.",{"children":"If the workload estimate includes the same activity twice, the output will overstate credits. Review course totals and assessment weeks. Keep intermediate values unrounded where possible and round only the displayed planning result."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L28",null,{"id":"tools/ects-workload-calculator:section-4","title":"Check your progress","items":["The period is defined: course, semester or year","Independent study is included when applicable","Hours-per-credit value comes from the institution","No activity is counted twice","The result is labelled a workload estimate"]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
26:["$","section","4-Use the estimate in an application file",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Use the estimate in an application file"}],[["$","p","Keep the course catalogue or workload statement alongside the calculation. If a university asks for credit evidence, provide the official record rather than this tool’s result as a replacement. A transparent worksheet can help explain your estimate, but the university makes the decision.",{"children":"Keep the course catalogue or workload statement alongside the calculation. If a university asks for credit evidence, provide the official record rather than this tool’s result as a replacement. A transparent worksheet can help explain your estimate, but the university makes the decision."}],["$","p","For Germany admission, follow the programme’s requirements for subject credits and qualification checks. For Italy, use the specific course call. This calculator does not decide whether your degree meets either system’s admission rules.",{"children":"For Germany admission, follow the programme’s requirements for subject credits and qualification checks. For Italy, use the specific course call. This calculator does not decide whether your degree meets either system’s admission rules."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Use the estimate in an application file","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/study-in-germany-admission-requirements/",{"href":"/guides/study-in-germany-admission-requirements/","children":["Germany admission requirements",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/study-in-italy-admission-english-requirements/",{"href":"/guides/study-in-italy-admission-english-requirements/","children":["Italy admissions and language requirements",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/tools/gpa-cgpa-calculator/",{"href":"/tools/gpa-cgpa-calculator/","children":["GPA and credit-weighted grades",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
27:["$","section","5-Working with US quarter and semester credits?",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Working with US quarter and semester credits?"}],[["$","p","ECTS describes workload under a different credit system. For the common US quarter/semester volume ratio, use the dedicated converter and keep the school's awarded credits separate from the estimate. It does not convert US credits into ECTS.",{"children":"ECTS describes workload under a different credit system. For the common US quarter/semester volume ratio, use the dedicated converter and keep the school's awarded credits separate from the estimate. It does not convert US credits into ECTS."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Working with US quarter and semester credits?","children":[["$","$L4","/tools/quarter-to-semester-credits-calculator/",{"href":"/tools/quarter-to-semester-credits-calculator/","children":["Quarter credits to semester credits calculator",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
